{
 "html": "<section class=\"section_contact-else theme-light\" data-frame=\"other-frequencies\" aria-labelledby=\"else-h\"><span class=\"ab_frame-label\" data-frame-label=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▢ other-frequencies</span><div class=\"ab_light-glow is-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_light-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"ab_ct-else_pad\"><div class=\"ab_sec-h\"><div class=\"ab_section-head is-flush\"><div class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">/elsewhere · other frequencies</div><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\" id=\"else-h\" data-split=\"\">Other <span class=\"t-outline\">channels</span></h2></div><p class=\"ab_sec-h_lede text-size-lede\">Prefer another frequency? All of these reach the same desk.</p></div><div class=\"ab_ct-cells\"><div class=\"ab_ct-cell\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Card / direct-line\"><div class=\"ab_ct-cell_k\">Direct line</div><h3 class=\"ab_ct-cell_h\">Email</h3><p class=\"ab_ct-cell_p\">Write straight in. Replies come from me, not a ticket system.</p><a class=\"button is-ghost is-email is-contact\" href=\"#\" data-copy-email=\"\"><span class=\"ab_button-label\" data-bind=\"email\">hello@[your-domain]</span><span class=\"ab_footer_email-copy\">Copy</span></a></div><div class=\"ab_ct-cell\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Card / voice-channel\"><div class=\"ab_ct-cell_k\">Voice channel · 103.8</div><h3 class=\"ab_ct-cell_h\">Book a call</h3><p class=\"ab_ct-cell_p\">Thirty minutes to talk it through. Send a few times that work and I’ll reply with a link.</p><a class=\"button is-ghost\" href=\"#channel\" data-magnetic=\"\" data-ct-station=\"1\"><span class=\"ab_button-label\">Tune to 103.8</span><span class=\"ab_button-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></a></div><div class=\"ab_ct-cell\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Card / mission-control\"><div class=\"ab_ct-cell_k\">Mission control</div><h3 class=\"ab_ct-cell_h\">Replies in one business day</h3><div class=\"ab_ct-facts text-style-mono\"><div class=\"ab_ct-fact\"><span class=\"ab_ct-fact_dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span data-bind=\"availability\">Available</span></div><div class=\"ab_ct-fact\">Local time <span class=\"ab_ct-fact_v\" data-ct-clock=\"\">--:--</span> <span data-bind=\"tz-label\">ET</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ab_ct-cell\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Card / elsewhere\"><div class=\"ab_ct-cell_k\">Elsewhere</div><h3 class=\"ab_ct-cell_h\">Say hi in public</h3><div class=\"ab_ct-social\"><a class=\"ab_footer_link\" href=\"#\" data-social=\"linkedin\">LinkedIn ↗</a><a class=\"ab_footer_link\" href=\"#\" data-social=\"behance\">Behance ↗</a><a class=\"ab_footer_link\" href=\"#\" data-social=\"github\">GitHub ↗</a><a class=\"ab_footer_link\" href=\"#\" data-social=\"dribbble\">Dribbble ↗</a></div></div></div><div class=\"ab_ct-route\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Banner / scoping\"><div class=\"ab_ct-route_copy\"><div class=\"ab_ct-cell_k\">Scoping a whole mission?</div><p class=\"ab_ct-route_p\">The planner and the flight plan are built for that: pick the services, set a budget, get a quote.</p></div><div class=\"ab_ct-route_btns\"><a class=\"button is-primary\" href=\"/#launch\" data-magnetic=\"\"><span class=\"ab_button-shine\"></span><span class=\"ab_button-label\">Open the mission planner</span><span class=\"ab_button-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"button is-ghost\" href=\"/process#launch\" data-magnetic=\"\"><span class=\"ab_button-label\">See the flight plan</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
 "css": ".section_contact-else{position:relative}\n.ab_ct-else_pad{padding-top:clamp(56px,7vw,100px);padding-bottom:clamp(56px,7vw,100px)}\n.ab_ct-cells{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));grid-row-gap:1px;grid-column-gap:1px;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);background-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair)}\n.ab_ct-cell{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;grid-row-gap:10px;grid-column-gap:10px;padding-top:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-right:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-bottom:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-left:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);background-color:var(--_color---neutral--panel)}\n.ab_ct-cell_k{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_ct-cell_h{font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(20px,1.7vw,26px);line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase}\n.ab_ct-cell_p{font-size:15px;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.button.is-ghost.is-email.is-contact{max-width:100%;margin-top:auto}\n.ab_ct-facts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_ct-fact{display:flex;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px}\n.ab_ct-fact_dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-top-left-radius:50%;border-top-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-left-radius:50%;background-color:var(--_color---status--live)}\n.ab_ct-fact_v{color:var(--_color---text--primary);font-weight:500}\n.ab_ct-social{display:flex;flex-direction:column;grid-row-gap:6px;grid-column-gap:6px;margin-top:auto}\n.ab_ct-route{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:16px;grid-column-gap:28px;margin-top:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-top:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);padding-right:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);padding-bottom:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);padding-left:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong)}\n.ab_ct-route_copy{flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;flex-basis:380px}\n.ab_ct-route_p{max-width:52ch;margin-top:6px;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_ct-route_btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;grid-row-gap:12px;grid-column-gap:12px}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n.ab_ct-cells{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n.ab_ct-cells{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}\n}\n"
}